{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111310","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1211131001:0":{"text":"왜 아직도 다 고치지 못한 거지? 시간이 꽤 지났고, 나무판자도 준비되어 있는데... 대체 뭐 하고 있는 거야?","source_cn":"怎么还没有修好？这么长时间了，木板也都是现成的，你们到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9113867F1DD68FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211131002:0":{"text":"두, 두목! 저흰 정말 게으름을 피우지 않았어요.\n배를 고치는 것뿐 아니라 보초도 서야 하고, 나라 님도 지켜봐야 하고...","source_cn":"当、当家！我们真的没偷懒啊。\\n只是除了修这艘船，我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF766EBE9DCD644CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211131003:0":{"text":"맞습니다! 나라 님이 계속 깨질 않으시는데 갑판 위에서 자게 내버려둘 수가 없어서...","source_cn":"对对！奈拉大姐头一直没醒，也不能就让她睡在甲板上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE66C76020BFF9AFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211131004:0":{"text":"제가 계속 지켜보고 있었습니다! 걱정 마세요, 나라 님은 깨어날 기미가 안 보입니다!","source_cn":"我一直看守着她们！请放心，奈拉没有苏醒的迹象！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C4D2A5B4A472EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1211131004":{"text":"제가 계속 지켜보고 있었습니다! 걱정 마세요, 나라 님은 깨어날 기미가 안 보입니다!","source_cn":"我一直看守着她们！请放心，奈拉没有苏醒的迹象！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C4D2A5B4A472EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211131006:0":{"text":"이게 어떻게 된 거지? 잠깐, 나라는 우리랑 같이 보물을 찾으러 갔던 거 아니었어?","source_cn":"这是怎么回事？等一下，她不是和我们一起去寻宝了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0E663482483B6A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211131007:0":{"text":"나라는 조금 전까지도 소니아를 따라다녔는데...?","source_cn":"她一直跟着索尼娅，直到刚才……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E8C60E2DB49C73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211131008:0":{"text":"이봐, 소니아, 네... 네 등 뒤에?!","source_cn":"喂，索尼娅，你——你身后？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x486DA74FF1F7D297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211131009:0":{"text":"...아무도 없어.","source_cn":"——没有人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF9839B41AA6CCDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211131010:0":{"text":"설마 네 여동생이! 조, 좀비...!?","source_cn":"难道你妹妹！诈、诈……！？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF73CFDAB33599B1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211131011:0":{"text":"...좀비가 아니야.","source_cn":"……不是诈尸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3F42F14657946B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211131012:0":{"text":"뭐? 그럼 우리가 본 나라는 대체...","source_cn":"啊？那我们看见的奈拉到底是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x068F734D9CD24A48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1211131012":{"text":"뭐? 그럼 우리가 본 나라는 대체...","source_cn":"啊？那我们看见的奈拉到底是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x068F734D9CD24A48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211131013:0":{"text":"드림 아일랜드에서의 탐험은 그저 꿈이었다는 거야? 그럼 내 손에 왜 나침반이 있는 거지?","source_cn":"你说藏梦岛的探险之旅，其实只是一场梦？那为什么我手里多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0EF7E787477852B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1211131014:0":{"text":"우리가 꿈속으로 들어갔고, 꿈속에서 일어난 모든 것이 우리에게는 사실이기 때문이에요.","source_cn":"因为我们进入了梦中，梦中发生的一切，对我们来说都是真实的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0ADF6FE422493F93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1211131015:0":{"text":"나라는... 그레이브본은